        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "R = \\sqrt{R_x^2 + R_y^2} = \\sqrt{664^2 + 625^2} = 912{,}1\\ \\text{N}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "odnosno\n",
